<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D702RX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the throttle position sensor connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals. (For terminals, refer to <xref label="Seep02" href="X39400000QV01SD"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A154768J03" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>Resistance:</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.41in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Between A96 (VCTA) and 5 (VC) - Body ground</ptxt>
